==Description==
'''v1.91.0''' is the one hundred and forty-third update to be released in Tower Defense Simulator, on the 22nd of May 2026. This update is notable for adding the [[Backyard Legends Event]].

Additionally, the countdown icon used during this update was accidentally deployed to [[w:c:alter-ego:V0.8.10#Gallery|''ALTER EGO'']].

This update encompassed nine versions, the main v1.91.0 update (released 22 May 2026) and eight minor updates, the v1.91.1 (released 22 of May 2026), v1.91.1a (released 22 of May 2026), v1.91.2 (released 22 of May 2026), v1.91.3 (released 25 May 2026), v1.91.4 (released 25 May 2026), v1.91.4a (27 May 2026), v1.91.5 (released 28 May 2026) and v1.91.6 (released 29 May 2026).

